{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 48,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "Great is the LORD, and greatly to be praised, in the city of our God, in his holy mountain.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华本为大！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華本為大！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "Beautiful in elevation, the joy of the whole earth, is Mount Zion, on the north sides, the city of the great King.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "—大君王的城，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "－大君王的城，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "God has shown himself in her citadels as a refuge.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "神在其宫中，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "上帝在其宮中，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "For, behold, the kings assembled themselves, they passed by together.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "看哪，众王会合，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "看哪，眾王會合，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "They saw it, then they were amazed. They were dismayed. They hurried away.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他们见了这城就惊奇丧胆，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他們見了這城就驚奇喪膽，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "Trembling took hold of them there, as of a woman in travail.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他们在那里被战兢疼痛抓住，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他們在那裏被戰兢疼痛抓住，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "With the east wind, you break the ships of Tarshish.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "，你用东风打破的船只。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "，你用東風打破的船隻。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "As we have heard, so we have seen, in the city of the LORD of Armies, in the city of our God. will establish it forever.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我们在万军之耶和华的城中",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我們在萬軍之耶和華的城中",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "We have thought about your loving kindness, God, in the middle of your temple.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "神啊，我们在你的殿中想念你的慈爱。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "上帝啊，我們在你的殿中想念你的慈愛。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "10",
      "en": {
        "text": "As is your name, God, is your praise to the ends of the earth. Your right hand is full of righteousness.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "神啊，你受的赞美正与你的名相称，直到地极！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "上帝啊，你受的讚美正與你的名相稱，直到地極！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "11",
      "en": {
        "text": "Let Mount Zion be glad! Let the daughters of Judah rejoice because of your judgments.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "因你的判断，应当欢喜， 的城邑应当快乐。",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "- 48:11 原文是女子"
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "因你的判斷，應當歡喜， 的城邑應當快樂。",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "- 48:11 原文是女子"
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "12",
      "en": {
        "text": "Walk about Zion, and go around her.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你们当周游，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你們當周遊，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "13",
      "en": {
        "text": "Notice her bulwarks. her palaces, you may tell it to the next generation.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "细看她的外郭，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "細看她的外郭，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "14",
      "en": {
        "text": "For this God is our God forever and ever. He will be our guide even to death.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "因为这 神永永远远为我们的 神；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "因為這上帝永永遠遠為我們的上帝；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}